    // The crew's chains (`coop-missions` design 5): counted once a world,
    // from every player's deeds, each hand's share kept. `hands: n` is met
    // only once n different players have counted toward it (never more
    // than the crew has had, so a world played alone can finish it);
    // `each: n` once every player in the world for `grace_s` seconds has
    // counted n. Words: `crew_mission.<id>.*` in the locale file.
    //
    // "Raise a house together": H5, the ridge beam set by two at once, waits
    // for the step for two (`coop-missions` task 3.3), so the roof follows
    // the walls. The site's flat top and the hearth's being inside are not
    // checked yet.
